requirements.text:
Minimum RI values for a red Class IA/IB retro-reflector (vertical β1 / horizontal β2):
- at angle of divergence 20': 300 mcd/lx at 0°/0°; 200 mcd/lx at ±10°/0°; 100 mcd/lx at ±5°/±20°;
- at angle of divergence 1°30': 5 mcd/lx at 0°/0°; 2.8 mcd/lx at ±10°/0°; 2.5 mcd/lx at ±5°/±20°.
